---
layout: base.njk
title: Insights
description: Field notes from Vertis Global. Essays, patterns, and findings from real transformation, managed services, and staffing engagements.
permalink: /insights/
---

<section class="section pt-20 md:pt-28 pb-16 md:pb-24">
  <div class="wrapper grid-edit">
    <div class="col-span-12">
      <h1 class="font-display font-medium text-hero leading-[0.98] tracking-[-0.035em] text-balance reveal-mask">
        <span>Field notes</span>
        <span class="block italic text-ink-secondary">from the team.</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-8 md:mt-10 text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl text-ink-secondary reveal reveal-delay-2 pretty">
        Essays on data platforms, cloud costs, managed ML, and staffing math. Written by the teams doing the work.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section border-t border-ink-primary">
  <div class="wrapper">
    {% set posts = collections.insights %}
    {% if posts and posts.length %}
      <ul>
        {% for post in posts %}
          <li class="reveal reveal-delay-{{ (loop.index0 % 4) + 1 }}">
            <a href="{{ post.url }}" class="group flex items-start gap-5 md:gap-10 py-8 md:py-10 border-t border-ink-primary {% if loop.last %}border-b{% endif %} transition-colors duration-300 hover:bg-bg-subtle">
              <span class="meta pt-2 text-ink-secondary shrink-0 hidden md:inline">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
              <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
                <h3 class="font-display font-medium text-2xl md:text-3xl lg:text-4xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em]">{{ post.data.title }}</h3>
                <p class="mt-3 text-ink-secondary pretty">{{ post.data.description }}</p>
                <span class="meta md:hidden block mt-3 text-ink-secondary">{{ post.data.date | readableDate }}</span>
              </div>
              <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 16 16" fill="none" class="mt-3 shrink-0 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 8h12m0 0L9 3m5 5l-5 5" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="square"/></svg>
            </a>
          </li>
        {% endfor %}
      </ul>
    {% else %}
      <div class="reveal py-16 md:py-24 flex flex-col gap-8 max-w-3xl">
        <span class="meta" style="color: var(--color-pixel-yellow)">
          <span class="section-number" style="--accent: var(--color-pixel-yellow)">In progress</span>
        </span>
        <h2 class="font-display font-medium text-3xl md:text-5xl leading-tight tracking-[-0.02em] balance">
          First pieces publish with the launch.
        </h2>
        <p class="text-lg text-ink-secondary pretty">
          Three pieces are in draft. Why generic data platforms fail. A quarterly review template for managed services customers. The staffing math every growing engineering team eventually writes down.
        </p>
      </div>
    {% endif %}
  </div>
</section>
